Third-party components
================================================================================

Goodtype links the Typst compiler into its own binary and embeds the fonts that
compiler ships with, so a built Goodtype executable redistributes the work
listed below. The licences that apply to it travel with that binary.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Typst — Apache License 2.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  typst, typst-assets, typst-ide, typst-kit, typst-layout, typst-pdf, typst-svg
  Copyright the Typst contributors
  https://github.com/typst/typst

Goodtype compiles Typst in-process rather than invoking a separate binary, so
the compiler is statically linked rather than merely called.

